<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90125" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστᾰτ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be leader</i> or <i>ruler of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτε χοροῦ εἴτε οἴκου εἴτε πόλεως
					εἴτε στρατεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.4.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hier.</u>
				11.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσίας</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).73.34
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>, prob.): abs., <i>exercise
				authority</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.3.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Vect.</u>
				5.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς πόλεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.8.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὅπως . . </span><i>to have authority
				for providing</i> that . . , <i>provide</i> or <i>take
			care</i> that . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.6.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.2.5
			</span></i>: with gen. added, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀνθρώπων ὅπως
				ἕξουσιν . . </span>ib. <i><span class="en">
				1.6.7
			</span></i>; cf. sq. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>hold office of</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστάτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				241
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				39
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.208
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Acrae</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>to be guardian of, regent for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν βασιλέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Syr.</u>
					52
				</span></i>
			.</div>
